  "description": "<p data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"634\">The <strong data-start=\"344\" data-end=\"367\">ceramic rattan tray</strong> is a beautiful fusion of natural craftsmanship and functional design, handcrafted in Vietnam. It features a smooth, glazed <strong data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"507\">ceramic base</strong> encased in a handwoven <strong data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"547\">rattan frame</strong>, combining the durability of ceramic with the warmth and texture of natural materials.</p>\n<p data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"864\">Ideal for serving food, tea sets, desserts, or simply as a decorative piece, this tray adds rustic elegance to both modern and traditional interiors. It&#8217;s perfect for use in hotels, restaurants, cafes, spas, and retail displays.</p>\n<p data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"1054\">As a direct <strong data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"917\">manufacturer and wholesale supplier</strong> in Vietnam, <strong data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"961\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd</strong> offers OEM/ODM services, custom designs, and bulk export solutions for international buyers.</p>\n<p data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"1054\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-752 aligncenter\" src=\"https://vietcraft.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/VH24105-Vietnam-ceramic-rattan-tray-400x400.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\" /></p>\n<hr data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1059\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1083\">✅ <strong data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1083\">Key Features:</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1370\">\n<li data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1107\">\n<p data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1107\">Handmade in Vietnam</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1163\">\n<p data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1163\">Durable ceramic center with protective rattan frame</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1216\">\n<p data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1216\">Ideal for serving, decoration, or retail display</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1270\">\n<p data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1270\">Available in multiple sizes, colors, and patterns</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1317\">\n<p data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1317\">Customizable logo, packaging, and branding</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1370\">\n<p data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1370\">Perfect for hotels, cafes, home decor, and gifting</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1375\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1404\">🌿 <strong data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1402\">Why It Matters:</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1474\">This ceramic and rattan tray not only elevates presentation but also:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1790\">\n<li data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1519\">\n<p data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1519\"><strong data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1517\">Uses 100% local materials and labor</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1591\">\n<p data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1591\"><strong data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1557\">Creates jobs for rural artisans</strong> during agricultural off-seasons</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1652\">\n<p data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1652\"><strong data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1622\">Generates foreign income</strong> for Vietnam’s craft economy</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1722\">\n<p data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1722\"><strong data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1720\">Helps preserve traditional Vietnamese handcrafting techniques</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1790\">\n<p data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1790\">Supports sustainable development through eco-conscious sourcing</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1944\"><strong data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1823\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd</strong> is proud to be a trusted <strong data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1895\">factory, manufacturer, and global exporter</strong